{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistrationfailure:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistrationFailure:","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","title":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Handles push notification registration failure.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistrationFailure:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","text":"NSError"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"error","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The NSError received from APNs registration failure","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application:didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to notify Pushwoosh about registration failures."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This allows Pushwoosh to:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Log the error for debugging","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retry registration if appropriate"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update device status in the Control Panel","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2,"anchor":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle registration failure with user feedback:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError error: Error) {","","        \/\/ Forward to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistrationFailure(error as NSError)","","        \/\/ Log for debugging","        Logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","","        \/\/ Handle specific error cases","        let nsError = error as NSError","        switch nsError.code {","        case 3010:","            \/\/ Simulator or push not supported","            Logger.warning(\"Push notifications not supported on this device\")","","        default:","            \/\/ Track error in analytics","            Analytics.track(\"push_registration_failed\", properties: [","                \"error_code\": nsError.code,","                \"error_message\": nsError.localizedDescription","            ])","","            \/\/ Optionally notify user","            if shouldShowPushError {","                showPushRegistrationError()","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/handlePushRegistrationFailure:":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Handles push notification registration failure.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistrationFailure:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistrationfailure:","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","title":"PWConfiguration","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PWConfiguration"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","abstract":[],"role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"title":"PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection"}}}